  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Health Security Program (GHSP) for enhancing prevention, detection and response to  emerging, re-emerging and endemic zoonoses and AMR threats in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program is expected to realize the following three outcomes by the end of 2024:
1) Improved collaboration among actors/sectors
2) Enhanced knowledge on and/or reduced incidence and spread of emerging and neglected infectious zoonotic diseases
3) Improved mitigation measures against AMR emergence and spread in the livestock sector</narrative>
  </description>
